 LLM Tool Use Interview Guide: Function Calling, MCP, and Agent Orchestration
 Complete guide to LLM tool use interviews in 2026. Covers function calling vs code execution vs MCP, tool schema design, parallel tool calls, error handling, security, and evaluation of tool-calling agents.
